### Enhancements

* Replace chaining of `cmd.exe` and PowerShell for activation scripts in Windows shortcuts with a simple, minimized `cmd.exe` call. This is less likely to trigger Windows security software. (#468 via #553)

### Bug fixes

* Use `activate.bat` for Windows shortcuts instead of using an activator command so that shortcut behavior does not depend on environment state during install time. (#321, #545 via #553)

